<% content_for :page_title, "企业资料详情" %>
<div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><div><%= link_to "返回资料库", library_entries_path, class: "text-sm text-cyan-700" %><h1 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold"><%= @entry.title %></h1><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500"><%= LibraryEntry::KINDS.fetch(@entry.kind) %> · 版本 <%= @entry.revision_number %> · <%= @entry.organization %></p></div><%= link_to "维护资料", edit_library_entry_path(@entry), class: "h-fit rounded-md bg-slate-900 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-white" if policy(@entry).update? %></div>
<% unless @entry.usable? %><p role="status" class="mt-4 rounded-md border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 p-3 text-sm text-amber-800">本资料已过期或归档，禁止新增投标引用；历史引用仍保留。</p><% end %>
<div class="mt-4 grid gap-4 xl:grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(280px,1fr)]">
  <section class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5"><h2 class="font-bold">资料说明</h2><p class="mt-3 whitespace-pre-wrap text-sm leading-7"><%= @entry.description %></p><h2 class="mt-6 border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 font-bold">证明附件</h2><ul class="mt-3 divide-y divide-slate-100"><% @entry.documents.each do |file| %><li class="flex justify-between gap-3 py-3 text-sm"><span><%= file.filename %> · <%= number_to_human_size(file.byte_size) %></span><%= link_to "下载", download_library_entry_path(@entry, attachment_id: file.id), class: "font-semibold text-cyan-700" %></li><% end %></ul><% if @entry.documents.empty? %><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-amber-700">尚未上传证明原件，不应仅凭文字认定资质或业绩有效。</p><% end %></section>
  <aside class="h-fit rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5"><h2 class="font-bold">登记信息</h2><dl class="mt-3 space-y-3 text-sm"><div><dt class="text-slate-500">编号</dt><dd><%= @entry.reference_number.presence || "—" %></dd></div><div><dt class="text-slate-500">签发 / 完成日期</dt><dd><%= @entry.issued_on || "未设置" %></dd></div><div><dt class="text-slate-500">有效期</dt><dd><%= @entry.expires_on || "未设置" %></dd></div><div><dt class="text-slate-500">状态</dt><dd><%= status_badge(@entry.status) %></dd></div><div><dt class="text-slate-500">登记人</dt><dd><%= @entry.created_by.name %></dd></div></dl><p class="mt-4 border-t border-slate-200 pt-3 text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500">平台记录资料与引用，不自动认证证书真实性或履约质量。</p></aside>
</div>
